  {"dato":"Nombre real: Christopher \"2irie\" Harris; mitad barbadense y mitad inglés, con estatus \"latino\" adoptado tras vivir en Venezuela más de una década","url":"https://soundcloud.com/2irie","cita":"Half Barbadian and half English with an adopted \"Latino\" status after living in Venezuela for over a decade, Christopher \"2irie\" Harris has earned his place in this ever growing world of bass music."},
  {"dato":"Tras 13 años en la escena venezolana regresó a Barbados para reconectar con sus raíces","url":"https://soundcloud.com/2irie","cita":"After 13 years mashing up the scene in Venezuela, 2irie returns to Barbados to rediscover his roots and bring his particular style of reggae and soca influenced bass music to the next level."},
